<code>assert m != null => this.size() == \old(m.size());</code>

However, given the context of the `putAll` method, the correct assertion should reflect that the size of the map after `putAll` is the sum of the original size and the size of the input map. Here is the corrected assert statement:

<code>assert m != null => this.size() == \old(this.size()) + m.size();</code>
--------------------
<code>assert m != null => this.size() == m.size();</code>
--------------------
<code>assert m != null => this.size() == m.size();</code>
--------------------
